WEBVTT

00:06.040 --> 00:10.840
I am Prince of Jin Sikong Yao of Great Xuan I promise you all Great Xuan has never for a day.

00:10.920 --> 00:16.920
Forgotten the people of the north the royal army will surely recover the homeland return to everyone.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.400
A peaceful realm.

00:19.480 --> 00:20.880
How wonderful.

00:22.120 --> 00:27.707
Great Xuan hasn't forgotten us the royal army has finally come, Your Highness let's hurry on our way.

00:28.680 --> 00:31.320
Military duties call cannot stay long.

00:41.440 --> 00:42.840
For you.

00:52.360 --> 00:53.760
Continue on our way.

00:55.560 --> 01:00.400
In September Xuan Kingdom's great army crossed the Tianhe went fully north.

01:01.000 --> 01:06.800
The northern regions heard the news and opened their gates to welcome righteous armies also rose in response.

01:07.560 --> 01:13.000
To pave the way for the returning royal army they did not fear death and spared no cost.

01:13.360 --> 01:18.800
Therefore all armies quickly followed the plan and occupied all strategic locations.

01:20.000 --> 01:25.960
However two months later the Wutu organized a great army divided into three routes going south quickly retook.

01:26.040 --> 01:32.480
Some cities any city that opened its gates to welcome the Xuan army was completely massacred.

01:54.240 --> 02:00.360
The Wutu great army from the east west north surrounded the city on three sides according to scouts' reports they brought.

02:00.440 --> 02:05.907
A craftsmen camp to build rams on site catapults they probably won't attack immediately.

02:07.360 --> 02:13.547
Report General military report has arrived let's go back to the council hall.

02:18.040 --> 02:24.400
This military report is already three days old the Wutu Great Chanyu ayidai personally leads one hundred thirty thousand infantry and cavalry.

02:24.480 --> 02:30.907
Toward General Zu Kun who garrisons Xingyang right General ayigu leads twenty thousand cavalry to intercept Zu Yue's forces.

02:31.000 --> 02:34.760
Surrounding us now is Left General Shilang leading fifty thousand tribesmen.

